man, I want you to be my personal assistant, manage my inbox and calendar, set up meetings, and frees up your time for focused work.\\\",\\n      \\\"role\\\": \\\"Personal Assistant\\\",\\n      \\\"description\\\": \\\"Manages your inbox and calendar, sets up meetings, and frees you for focused work.\\\",\\n      \\\"tags\\\": [\\n        \\\"#EmailTriage\\\",\\n        \\\"#CalendarSync\\\"\\n      ]\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\\"id\\\": \\\"tech_cofounder\\\",\\n      \\\"displayName\\\": \\\"Tech Co-founder\\\",\\n      \\\"agentInput\\\": \\\"Hey wingman, I want you to be my tech co-founder, take my business online, build my websites and apps, and ship while I sleep.\\\",\\n      \\\"role\\\": \\\"Tech Co-founder\\\",\\n      \\\"description\\\": \\\"Takes your business online, builds your websites and apps, and ships while you sleep.\\\",\\n      \\\"tags\\\": [\\n        \\\"#WebsitesAndApps\\\",\\n        \\\"#LaunchFast\\\"\\n      ]\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\\"id\\\": \\\"creator\\\",\\n      \\\"displayName\\\": \\\"Content Creator\\\",\\n      \\\"agentInput\\\": \\\"Hey wingman, I want you to be my content creator, generate videos and images, write viral posts, and keep my feed engaged.\\\",\\n      \\\"role\\\": \\\"Content Creator\\\",\\n      \\\"description\\\": \\\"Generates videos and images, writes viral posts, and keeps your feed engaged.\\\",\\n      \\\"tags\\\": [\\n        \\\"#VideosAndImages\\\",\\n        \\\"#ViralPosts\\\"\\n      ]\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\\"id\\\": \\\"marketing_manager\\\",\\n      \\\"displayName\\\": \\\"Marketing Manager\\\",\\n      \\\"agentInput\\\": \\\"Hey wingman, I want you to be my marketing manager, run my Meta and Google Ads and turn spend into customers.\\\",\\n      \\\"role\\\": \\\"Marketing Manager\\\",\\n      \\\"description\\\": \\\"Runs your Meta, Google Ads and turns spend into customers.\\\",\\n      \\\"tags\\\": [\\n        \\\"#AdCampaigns\\\",\\n        \\\"#AdsOnAutopilot\\\"\\n      ]