 — Friday Planting\",\"orgSlug\":\"blackrod-bloomers\",\"category\":\"Volunteering\",\"start\":\"2026-07-10T08:00:00.000Z\",\"end\":\"2026-07-10T10:00:00.000Z\",\"venue\":\"Around the village\",\"address\":\"Blackrod\",\"description\":\"Friday morning planting/maintenance with the Bloomers.\",\"cost\":\"Free — volunteers welcome\",\"age\":\"All ages\",\"accessibility\":\"Outdoor\",\"booking\":\"\",\"contactEmail\":\"clerk@blackrodtowncouncil.gov.uk\",\"contactPhone\":\"01204 696362\",\"image\":\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1466692476868-aef1dfb1e735?w=1200&q=80\",\"featured\":false,\"status\":\"approved\"},{\"id\":\"evt-twilight-bookclub\",\"title\":\"Twilight Book Club\",\"orgSlug\":\"twilight-book-club\",\"category\":\"Community\",\"start\":\"2026-07-23T17:45:00.000Z\",\"end\":\"2026-07-23T19:00:00.000Z\",\"venue\":\"Blackrod Library\",\"address\":\"Church Street, Blackrod BL6 5EQ\",\"description\":\"Third-Thursday evening book club at the library. Average 10–15 readers.\",\"cost\":\"Free\",\"age\":\"Adults\",\"accessibility\":\"Step-free\",\"booking\":\"\",\"contactEmail\":\"\",\"contactPhone\":\"\",\"image\":\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1481627834876-b7833e8f5570?w=1200&q=80\",\"featured\":false,\"status\":\"approved\"},{\"id\":\"evt-reading-club\",\"title\":\"St Katharine's Monday Night Reading Club\",\"orgSlug\":\"monday-night-reading-club\",\"category\":\"Community\",\"start\":\"2026-08-03T19:30:00.000Z\",\"end\":\"2026-08-03T21:00:00.000Z\",\"venue\":\"St Katharine's Church\",\"address\":\"Church Street, Blackrod BL6 5TE\",\"description\":\"Last-Monday-of-the-month evening reading club. Free and open to new members.\",\"cost\":\"Free\",\"age\":\"Adults\",\"accessibility\":\"Step-free\",\"booking\":\"\",\"contactEmail\":\"\",\"contactPhone\":\"\",\"image\":\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1521587760476-6c12a4b040da?w=1200&q=80\",\"featured\":false,\"status\":\"approved\"},{\"id\":\"evt-messy-church\",\"title\":\"Messy Church\",\"orgSlug\":\"messy-church-st-katharines\",\"category\":\"Family\",\"start\":\"2026-08-01T16:00:00.000Z\",\"end\":\"2026-08-01T18:00:00.000Z\",\"venue\":\"St Katharine's Church\",\"address\":\"Church Street, Blackrod BL6 5TE\",\"description\":\"Last-Saturday family Messy Church — craft, story, song and a meal. Around 30–35 children, 30 adults, 20 volunteers.\",\"cost\":\"Free\",\"age\":\"Family\",\"accessibility\":\"Step-free, baby change\",\"booking\":\"\",\"contactEmail\":\"\",\"contactPhone\":\"\",\"image\":\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1503454537195-1dcabb73ffb9?w=1200&q=80\",\"featured\":false,\"status\":\"approved\"},{\"id\":\"evt-history-meeting\",\"title\":\"Blackrod Local History Group — Monthly Meeting\",\"orgSlug\":\"blackrod-local-history-group\",\"category\":\"Heritage\",\"start\":\"2026-07-18T19:30:00.000Z\",\"end\":\"2026-07-18T21:00:00.000Z\",\"venue\":\"Blackrod Library / Council Chamber\",\"address\":\"Church Street, Blackrod BL6 5EQ\",\"description\":\"Monthly local history talk. £1 entry or £10 annual membership — refreshments included. Average attendance about 40.\",\"cost\":\"£1 entry or £10 annual\",\"age\":\"Adults\",\"accessibility\":\"Step-free\",\"booking\":\"\",\"contactEmail\":\"\",\"contactPhone\":\"\",\"image\":\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1521587760476-6c12a4b040da?w=1200&q=80\",\"featured\":false,\"status\":\"approved\"},{\"id\":\"evt-walking-group\",\"title\":\"Blackrod Community Walking Group — Monthly Walk\",\"orgSlug\":\"blackrod-community-walking-group\",\"category\":\"Health & Wellbeing\",\"start\":\"2026-07-11T10:00:00.000Z\",\"end\":\"2026-07-11T13:00:00.000Z\",\"venue\":\"Meet point on group page\",\"address\":\"Blackrod\",\"description\":\"A monthly local walk with the option of lunch afterwards. Friendly, sociable pace.\",\"cost\":\"Free\",\"age\":\"Adults\",\"accessibility\":\"Outdoor — pace varies\",\"booking\":\"\",\"contactEmail\":\"\",\"contactPhone\":\"\",\"image\":\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1551632811-561732d1e306?w=1200&q=80\",\"featured\":false,\"status\":\"approved\"},{\"id\":\"evt-pending-art\",\"title\":\"Art Group — Annual Library Exhibition Opening (Pending)\",\"orgSlug\":\"blackrod-art-group\",\"category\":\"Community\",\"start\":\"2026-07-28T18:00:00.000Z\",\"end\":\"2026-07-28T20:00:00.000Z\",\"venue\":\"Blackrod Library\",\"address\":\"Church Street, Blackrod BL6 5EQ\",\"description\":\"Opening evening of the Blackrod Art Group's 12-week library exhibition.\",\"cost\":\"Free\",\"age\":\"All ages\",\"accessibility\":\"Step-free\",\"booking\":\"\",\"contactEmail\":\"blackrodartgroup@gmail.com\",\"contactPhone\":\"07894 904100\",\"image\":\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1513364776144-60967b0f800f?w=1200&q=80\",\"featured\":false,\"status\":\"approved\"},{\"id\":\"4b184c73-e915-4c14-bbbc-19115ef659d1\",\"title\":\"RBL Blackrod 90th Anniversary Masquerade Ball\",\"orgSlug\":\"royal-british-legion-blackrod-brach\",\"category\":\"Community\",\"start\":\"2026-10-31T19:30:00.000Z\",\"end\":\"2026-10-31T23:59:00.000Z\",\"venue\":\"Hawthorns, Douglas Valley Golf Club\",\"address\":\"BL6 5HF\",\"description\":\"Celebrate 90 years of RBL Blackrod Branch service at this special Masquerade Ball welcoming local dignitaries. Dress to impress in suits, tuxedos, cocktail or ball gowns. Tickets are limited and available first-come, first-served via email.\",\"cost\":\"Free\",\"age\":\"All ages\",\"accessibility\":\"Please contact us for details\",\"booking\":\"\",\"contactEmail\":\"blackrodrbl@outlook.com\",\"contactPhone\":\"\",\"image\":\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1533174072545-7a4b6ad7a6c3?w=1200&q=80\",\"featured\":false,\"status\":\"approved\"},{\"id\":\"16c16c65-b5e2-4811-b3f1-1a135c1c0284\",\"title\":\"Baby Babble and Bond — Blackrod Young People's Centre\",\"orgSlug\":\"blackrod-young-peoples-centre\",\"category\":\"Family\",\"start\":\"2026-07-22T09:00:00.000Z\",\"end\":\"2026-07-22T10:00:00.000Z\",\"venue\":\"Blackrod Young People's Centre, BL6 5SY\",\"address\":\"Blackrod Young People's Centre, BL6 5SY\",\"description\":\"Drop-in fun and interactive group for families with babies 0–12 months. Songs, rhymes, sensory play, and chats on weaning, development, and oral health. Run by Family Hub Practitioners. *Weekly except 26 Aug (Tuesdays).\",\"cost\":\"Free\",\"age\":\"\",\"accessibility\":\"\",\"booking\":\"\",\"contactEmail\":\"\",\"contactPhone\":\"\",\"image\":\"\",\"featured\":false,\"status\":\"approved\"},{\"id\":\"32b49222-773a-4df7-9d99-44c903b08231\",\"title\":\"Chat, Play, Read — Blackrod Young People's Centre\",\"orgSlug\":\"blackrod-young-peoples-centre\",\"category\":\"Family\",\"start\":\"2026-07-22T09:00:00.000Z\",\"end\":\"2026-07-22T10:00:00.000Z\",\"venue\":\"Blackrod Young People's Centre, BL6 5SY\",\"address\":\"Blackrod Young People's Centre, BL6 5SY\",\"description\":\"Interactive group for families with children 12 months+. Songs, stories, sensory play, and craft to build communication, language, and literacy. Includes special REAL literacy activity session on 28 Jul. *Weekly except 25 Aug (Tuesdays).\",\"cost\":\"Free\",\"age\":\"\",\"accessibility\":\"\",\"booking\":\"\",\"contactEmail\":\"\",\"contactPhone\":\"\",\"image\":\"\",\"featured\":false,\"status\":\"approved\"},{\"id\":\"b453b68b-b6fe-4d4e-8711-0c8b5be12f1d\",\"title\":\"Bumps, Boobs, and Buggies Walking Group\",\"orgSlug\":\"blackrod-town-council\",\"category\":\"Health & Wellbeing\",\"start\":\"2026-07-21T09:00:00.000Z\",\"end\":\"2026-07-21T10:00:00.000Z\",\"venue\":\"Horwich Library\",\"address\":\"Horwich Library\",\"description\":\"Gentle Monday morning walk suitable for prams, toddlers, and slings. A great way to get fresh air, boost wellbeing, and meet other mums. *Weekly Mondays.\",\"cost\":\"Free\",\"age\":\"\",\"accessibility\":\"\",\"booking\":\"\",\"contactEmail\":\"\",\"contactPhone\":\"\",\"image\":\"\",\"featured\":false,\"status\":\"approved\"},{\"id\":\"ca429cf0-3053-473f-aa92-7f449995bc3d\",\"title\":\"Breastfeeding Group — Horwich Library\",\"orgSlug\":\"blackrod-town-council\",\"category\":\"Health & Wellbeing\",\"start\":\"2026-07-21T10:00:00.000Z\",\"end\":\"2026-07-21T11:00:00.000Z\",\"venue\":\"Horwich Library\",\"address\":\"Horwich Library\",\"description\":\"Drop-in group for breastfeeding parents. Come along to meet others, socialise, and access peer support. *Weekly Mondays.\",\"cost\":\"Free\",\"age\":\"\",\"accessibility\":\"\",\"booking\":\"\",\"contactEmail\":\"\",\"contactPhone\":\"\",\"image\":\"\",\"featured\":false,\"status\":\"approved\"},{\"id\":\"9dd6d86a-8fcb-45b0-9f9b-8642dac26f1f\",\"title\":\"Toddler Tales — Blackrod & Horwich Libraries\",\"orgSlug\":\"blackrod-town-council\",\"category\":\"Family\",\"start\":\"2026-07-23T09:30:00.000Z\",\"end\":\"2026-07-23T09:30:00.000Z\",\"venue\":\"Blackrod Library & Horwich Library\",\"address\":\"Blackrod Library & Horwich Library\",\"description\":\"Storytelling sessions for young children (ideal 2–5 years), mums, dads, and carers. No booking required. Continues in school holidays. *Weekly Thursdays.\",\"cost\":\"Free\",\"age\":\"\",\"accessibility\":\"\",\"booking\":\"\",\"contactEmail\":\"\",\"contactPhone\":\"\",\"image\":\"\",\"featured\":false,\"status\":\"approved\"},{\"id\":\"e3c3e2cc-4fc7-43c5-9ad3-924c700b3359\",\"title\":\"Baby Babble and Bond — Horwich Health and Wellbeing Hub\",\"orgSlug\":\"blackrod-town-council\",\"category\":\"Family\",\"start\":\"2026-07-25T08:30:00.000Z\",\"end\":\"2026-07-25T09:30:00.000Z\",\"venue\":\"Horwich Health and Wellbeing Hub\",\"address\":\"Horwich Health and Wellbeing Hub\",\"description\":\"Drop-in interactive group for families with babies 0–12 months. Songs, rhymes, sensory play, and topic chats. *Two sessions Fridays: 9:30am and 1:00pm. Not running 28 Aug.\",\"cost\":\"Free\",\"age\":\"\",\"accessibility\":\"\",\"booking\":\"\",\"contactEmail\":\"\",\"contactPhone\":\"\",\"image\":\"\",\"featured\":false,\"status\":\"approved\"},{\"id\":\"054de93e-fe35-43ed-9a4